  * tools/ is Vipunen, the library builder, and is licensed under the GNU Affero
    General Public License v3.0 or later. Its terms are in tools/LICENSE.

The two never link: they are separate programs in separate languages that
communicate only through a shared SQLite file. Nothing under AGPL is
incorporated into the MIT-licensed player.

